
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ms">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Salam Mesra Ustazah</title>

<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 30px 10px;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: transparent;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.scene {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 260px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.kotak-teks {
  width: 70%;
  padding: 22px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 3px solid #FFD700;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: transparent;
  color: #704214;
  opacity: 0;
  animation: masukTeks 2s ease-out 1.5s forwards;
}

.kotak-teks h2 {
  color: #FFD700;
  margin-top: 0;
}

.rembo {
  position: absolute;
  width: 120px;
  left: -140px;
  bottom: 15px;
  z-index: 2;
  animation: remboTolak 4s ease-in-out forwards;
}

@keyframes remboTolak {
  0% { left: -140px; }
  60% { left: 10%; }
  100% { left: 10%; }
}

@keyframes masukTeks {
  0% {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(80px);
  }
  100% {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateX(0);
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="scene">

  <img src="rembo.png" class="rembo" alt="Rembo">

  <div class="kotak-teks">
    <h2>🌸 SALAM MESRA DARIPADA USTAZAH 🌸</h2>

    <p><b>Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuh!</b> 👋</p>

    <p>Hai anak-anak yang dikasihi! Selamat datang ke laman pembelajaran Ustazah.</p>

    <p>Semoga anak-anak sentiasa ceria dan bersemangat untuk belajar.</p>

    <p><b>Jom kita belajar bersama-sama! 📚✨</b></p>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
